
# Reports Export Rule
Whenever the user requests to export a report or walkthrough, or when a tester agent completes a test run:
1. ALWAYS save or copy the markdown report to the user-story report folder in the Obsidian vault:
   C:\Users\AD\Documents\Obsidian\shancao\Nexora\user-story\report\
2. If the test involves browser live tests, E2E flows, or manual walkthroughs that generate screenshots or video recordings (e.g. .mp4, .webm), ALWAYS save these media assets into that same directory (C:\Users\AD\Documents\Obsidian\shancao\Nexora\user-story\report\) alongside the report.
This ensures all test evidence remains colocated and tied directly to the corresponding user stories.
